{"id":"trig","类型":"公式本","科目":"高数","讲":"0","名称":"三角公式与常用不等式","简称":"三角","简介":"化简、积分、比大小、证不等式时最常翻的初等公式。","intro":[{"t":"p","text":"积分里见到 $\\sin^2x$、$\\cos^2x$ 先降幂，见到 $\\sin mx\\cos nx$ 先积化和差；比较积分、夹逼时先想 $\\sin x<x$、$e^x\\ge1+x$、$\\ln(1+x)\\le x$ 这三条。"}],"sections":[{"id":"1","label":"1","title":"三角恒等式","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"pyth","name":"平方关系","tex":"\\sin^2x+\\cos^2x=1\n1+\\tan^2x=\\sec^2x,\\qquad 1+\\cot^2x=\\csc^2x","note":"第一条两边除以 $\\cos^2x$ 得第二条，除以 $\\sin^2x$ 得第三条。三角代换去根号全靠后两条。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"double","name":"二倍角","tex":"\\sin2x=2\\sin x\\cos x\n\\cos2x=\\cos^2x-\\sin^2x=2\\cos^2x-1=1-2\\sin^2x","note":"$\\cos2x$ 有三种写法，要哪种用哪种。","cor":"$\\tan2x=\\dfrac{2\\tan x}{1-\\tan^2x}$"},{"t":"f","id":"half","name":"降幂","tex":"\\sin^2x=\\frac{1-\\cos2x}{2}\n\\cos^2x=\\frac{1+\\cos2x}{2}","note":"积分 $\\sin^2x$、$\\cos^2x$ 一律先降幂。","cor":"$1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2\\dfrac x2$，$1+\\cos x=2\\cos^2\\dfrac x2$（极限、积分里去掉「1±cos」）。"},{"t":"f","id":"sum","name":"和差角","tex":"\\sin(\\alpha\\pm\\beta)=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta\\pm\\cos\\alpha\\sin\\beta\n\\cos(\\alpha\\pm\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta\\mp\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta","note":"$\\sin$ 是「异名相乘、符号不变」，$\\cos$ 是「同名相乘、符号相反」。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"prod","name":"积化和差","tex":"\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta=\\frac12\\big[\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)+\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)\\big]","note":"积分 $\\sin mx\\cos nx$ 时用。另两条：$\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta=\\frac12[\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)+\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)]$，$\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta=\\frac12[\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)]$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"univ","name":"万能代换","tex":"t=\\tan\\frac x2,\\qquad dx=\\frac{2\\,dt}{1+t^2}\n\\sin x=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2},\\qquad \\cos x=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2}","note":"三角有理式的积分，别的办法都不行时用它，一定能化成有理函数的积分。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"aux","name":"辅助角","tex":"a\\sin x+b\\cos x=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\,\\sin(x+\\varphi)","note":"其中 $\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}}$，$\\sin\\varphi=\\frac{b}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}}$。两项合成一项，最大值就是 $\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$。","cor":""}]},{"id":"2","label":"2","title":"常用不等式","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"sinx","name":"$\\sin x$ 与 $x$","tex":"\\sin x<x<\\tan x\\quad{\\left(0<x<\\frac\\pi2\\right)}","note":"比较积分、夹逼时最常用。另外 $|\\sin x|\\le|x|$ 对所有 $x$ 成立。","cor":"$\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}x\\le\\sin x\\le x$（$0\\le x\\le\\frac\\pi2$），左边那条直线是连接两端的弦。"},{"t":"f","id":"ex","name":"$e^x$ 与 $\\ln$","tex":"e^x\\ge1+x\\quad{(x\\in\\mathbb R)}\n\\ln(1+x)\\le x\\quad{(x>-1)}","note":"等号只在 $x=0$ 取到。几何意义：$e^x$ 的图像在切线 $y=1+x$ 上方，$\\ln(1+x)$ 的图像在切线 $y=x$ 下方。","cor":"$\\dfrac{x}{1+x}<\\ln(1+x)<x$（$x>0$）；数列里常用 $\\dfrac1{n+1}<\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac1n\\right)<\\dfrac1n$。"},{"t":"f","id":"amgm","name":"均值不等式","tex":"\\frac{a+b}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{ab}\\quad{(a,b\\ge0)}\n|ab|\\le\\frac{a^2+b^2}{2}","note":"第二条是二元极限夹逼的主力：$\\left|\\dfrac{xy}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\\right|\\le\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}{2}\\to0$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"abs","name":"绝对值","tex":"\\big||a|-|b|\\big|\\le|a\\pm b|\\le|a|+|b|\n\\left|\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx\\right|\\le\\int_a^b|f(x)|\\,dx\\quad{(a<b)}","note":"积分的估计、证明题里放缩用。","cor":""}]},{"id":"3","label":"3","title":"求和与因式分解","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"sums","name":"自然数求和","tex":"\\sum_{k=1}^nk=\\frac{n(n+1)}2\n\\sum_{k=1}^nk^2=\\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}6","note":"和式极限能直接求和时用它，结果和化成积分的一致。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"geom","name":"等比求和","tex":"1+q+q^2+\\cdots+q^{n-1}=\\frac{1-q^n}{1-q}\\quad{(q\\ne1)}","note":"$|q|<1$ 时 $n\\to\\infty$，和趋于 $\\dfrac1{1-q}$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"cube","name":"立方差、$n$ 次方差","tex":"a^3-b^3=(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)\na^n-b^n=(a-b)(a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+\\cdots+b^{n-1})","note":"根式有理化：$\\sqrt[3]{x}-1$ 乘 $\\sqrt[3]{x^2}+\\sqrt[3]{x}+1$ 就变成 $x-1$。","cor":"$a^3+b^3=(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2)$"}]}],"used":{"ex":[{"book":"gs05","sec":"1","title":"高数第5讲 · 节1 单调性与极值"},{"book":"gs05","sec":"2","title":"高数第5讲 · 节2 最值、零点个数与优化"}],"half":[{"book":"gs09","sec":"2","title":"高数第9讲 · 节2 换元：去根号、换上下限、用对称"}],"pyth":[{"book":"gs09","sec":"2","title":"高数第9讲 · 节2 换元：去根号、换上下限、用对称"}],"cube":[{"book":"gs09","sec":"4","title":"高数第9讲 · 节4 有理函数的积分：裂项"}],"double":[{"book":"gs14","sec":"4","title":"高数第14讲 · 节4 极坐标：先扫角度，再沿射线定半径"}]}}